Is it possible to use sampling weights with brms (rstanarm, or stan)? In case is relevant, this  <http://www.parisschoolofeconomics.eu/docs/dupraz-yannick/using-weights-in-stata(1).pdf>is how stata does it if you are using a frequentist approach.

